      <h1>Can a Physiotherapy Clinic Bill Your Insurance Directly? <em>Networks, Plan Rules and What to Check Before You Book</em></h1>
      <p>Many physiotherapy clinics in Canada can send the claim to your insurer at the appointment, so you pay only the part your plan leaves behind. Whether a given clinic can do it for you depends on the clinic, your insurer and your plan.</p>
      <p>This guide explains how direct billing works in practice, which networks clinics use, when you will still pay and claim yourself, and the checks worth doing before your first visit.</p>
      <p class="byline">By WellFinder · November 2026 · 5 min read</p>
    </div>
      </div>

  </section>

